{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:627","content":{"id":627,"title":"Bellman-Ford 算法","content":[{"children":[{"text":"Bellman-Ford 算法也是求解单源最短路径的算法，与 Dijkstra 算法不同的是，它能够处理负权边，即使允许图中存在权值为负数的边。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c0b7a8d2-75af-4bb7-8d6e-3f2f7bb7a7dd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"在讲解 Bellman-Ford 算法之前，我们来看一组操作","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"81c9c3af-6b7b-4ef6-abf7-68c9ab156fc1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"dis[w] = Math.min(dis[w], dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w));","collabId":"3cb6a44b-8c55-45da-91ea-9320e4487113","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"70ae7c53-ad78-446a-9be5-2f44d7729381","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"41bade78-c009-4671-ad82-5301c67e8a68"},{"children":[{"text":"这个操作叫做松弛操作。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"196d7c71-b800-4dcd-abe7-caa6eb337d3a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"为什么叫松弛，因为本来可以直接到达点 w，现在经过上面的操作之后，偏要经过点 v 然后到达 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"w","type":"formatted"},{"text":" (不一定会经过，只有当 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w) < dis[w]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 才会经过点 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"v","type":"formatted"},{"text":")，如果把边看做橡皮筋的话，不就相当于松弛了吗?","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"045f0d06-f644-4200-a175-6a747016a158","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"而 Bellman-Ford 算法就是，对所有的边进行 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V - 1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6e582c85-6037-42c6-b1a7-5bc71d4c3468","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V - 1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 轮松弛操作，这个 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0b4da75a-d4f8-4651-a7ce-d28a9dbba128","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 指的是图中的节点数目，经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V - 1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ec2f4d70-4f7f-4809-a487-1d0f2faad51a","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V - 1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 轮松弛操作后，此时 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dis","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 数组中保存的就是源点到各个节点的最短路径。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"de07fd9f-5016-41ff-8644-f2cce5d14067","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"为了理解 Bellman-Ford 算法为什么这么神奇，每个节点经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V-1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7ee9c7b3-54df-47c3-a0b3-c79c972bc13a","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V-1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 轮松弛操作之后就可以得到最短路径，我们还是要研究一下松弛操作","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"daa0c9e2-09af-4fe2-a6af-7a69a2916160","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"dis[w] = Math.min(dis[w], dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w));","collabId":"340b0575-65c9-4b44-ad78-24ca272cedfc","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f5c11d2a-9ab8-4f27-8f56-82afbe67d144","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"362712a3-2ec0-4017-9f85-3984779aadd0"},{"children":[{"text":"如果进行了松弛操作，意味源多经过了一条边到 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"w","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，所以如果我们设定 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dis[w]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 为源点最多经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"k","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e4788e90-fb04-48ce-8b9c-5e43140a0e34","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"k","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 条边到达点 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"w","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的最短路径，那么经过一次松弛操作之后 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dis[w]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 语义变为源点最多经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"k + 1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"543d61d7-ca0c-466b-a0df-65e8e88d626a","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"k + 1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 条边到达点 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"w","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的最短路径，因为一个节点到达另一个节点最多经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V-1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d55ddf6d-34d5-4c0c-af66-9d545eed8183","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V-1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 条边，因此经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V - 1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"35e8d513-26fa-4a07-9e6c-cd683c7301e1","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V - 1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 轮的松弛操作之后，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dis[w]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 语义变为了源点最多经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V - 1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eb7a5c84-2c07-43d8-972d-6b885bc4434f","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V - 1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 条边到达点 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"w","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的最短路径，考虑到了源点到达节点 w 能经过的边数的所有情况，所以最终的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dis[w]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 就是源点到点 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"w","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 的最短路径。 ","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3e9399c5-78a2-4d5c-a207-dd0a8e0f34b8","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"我们来看一个例子，假设源点为 0","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7d643a6c-31c2-4be1-9f80-ebd791a84f26","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"66a10779-d45f-4535-85dc-35a2e0f5cd06","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c311b39f-e9d9-4e71-94b2-cbd32d27f832.webp","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c311b39f-e9d9-4e71-94b2-cbd32d27f832.webp","uuid":"7af8b2a4-b321-4679-bc50-be836adb2423","width":516.6666461361788},{"children":[{"text":"图中有 4 个节点，因此要进行 3 轮松弛操作。第一次对所有边进行松弛操作","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d41ecbb9-19ec-4811-9253-332569ae7457","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d4b31186-7804-4027-872d-6b5bb4131c29","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106006283-052a2e00-60f0-11eb-9ae3-7a9ca4c241d2_0bd22b10-d135-4058-9a62-b10df65a1617.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106006283-052a2e00-60f0-11eb-9ae3-7a9ca4c241d2_0bd22b10-d135-4058-9a62-b10df65a1617.gif","uuid":"c2fa4a05-e621-4108-9c92-fd782ebbdb75","width":720},{"children":[{"text":"第二次对所有边进行松弛操作","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"02805945-0990-42ca-9ca1-e6dcde06ffb2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"793c70a9-bd95-4a9e-8710-25d47fafff24","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106007070-dd879580-60f0-11eb-96cf-1c3ba40e7271_7f3c926e-6dcf-4818-ad79-908d1105f791.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106007070-dd879580-60f0-11eb-96cf-1c3ba40e7271_7f3c926e-6dcf-4818-ad79-908d1105f791.gif","uuid":"d338612f-1c18-43ae-b425-32e66e0c86a8","width":720},{"children":[{"text":"第三次对所有边进行松弛操作","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"70c28293-0457-4968-9ce3-682c40385fdc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"b42e10e7-83c5-4cc1-874a-67c7a1ff4818","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106007575-6e5e7100-60f1-11eb-9883-dfc275196a2e_3e11a8da-8bee-4836-bce1-204e53524d82.gif","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106007575-6e5e7100-60f1-11eb-9883-dfc275196a2e_3e11a8da-8bee-4836-bce1-204e53524d82.gif","uuid":"06913a19-723b-4fd6-b4e8-cc3411cdd73c","width":720},{"children":[{"text":"最后得到的结果为","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"939ebbf8-58e9-4eb9-8a4c-2e56f4b51a77","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"38f7f5a9-b84d-457c-9dfe-8dd41d369160","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"0","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"90cc30c3-c9c2-44c4-ac81-830320982846","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"929baa76-a658-4286-95e1-60baed6fd908","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"2","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2fe3e207-f850-4dec-b1a0-686d0be07e9b","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"3","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e4eaa329-0073-4668-825a-c09957569754","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"d7f44efa-1989-4f0f-b6b6-88022b8302d7","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"dis","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"fffb1a19-06a8-427e-8ddd-91195ce7127e","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"0","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d65e8839-c485-4ff2-9f09-effc57b2ce42","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"4","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e95a64c7-e377-4a95-a5e0-eb158525415e","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f92533fb-30db-4451-8878-0559fe60afe9","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"},{"children":[{"text":"2","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"27ccc0a3-7e9e-42c9-af36-6e72ecdd3af2","tauContract":"033eeb00612c0b64d6796a4338e43503442ebcdf1d13aa5fb6bcac9f49abfc20","type":"table-cell"}],"collabId":"2b375252-099d-43b2-a634-4ff1fb9e86d6","tauContract":"e0390883f5755ceda18769fa110bf264bee6f2391ac403aab2a5f429a086d8ce","type":"table-row"}],"collabId":"74056cd5-4660-41c4-bb53-98787e97d91b","tauContract":"6b49184b8918108ccf1636963138d105f679894dfe0d7b7abd75a6e6db67056b","type":"table"},{"children":[{"text":"Bellman-Ford 虽然能够处理负权边，但是如果图中有负权环的话，那么就无法求解了，所谓的负权环是指环中所以边的路径和为负值，这样的只要我每次经过一次环，每个节点的 dis 值都在减少，如果图中存在负权环的话，那么根本就不存在最小路径。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cec550d9-4207-404a-b801-dbd9163e473d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"大家在考虑一个问题，对于无向图来说，如果图中出现了负权边意味着什么? 假设 0-1 是一个负权边，因为是无向图，可以从 0 到 1，也可以从 1-0，那么我们可以从 0 来到 1，然后从 1 来到 0，这就形成一个负权环。所以 Bellman-Ford 算法其实是一个有向图算法。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6d4e009c-a930-4dcf-880f-1f93dc69a75a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"另外我们可以通 Bellman-Ford 算法检测图中是否存在负权环，我们知道如果如果不存在负权环的话，经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V-1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dfadad87-0fd0-4818-819b-d6c454d32550","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V-1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 次松弛操作后，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dis","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 数组中的元素的值是不会再改变的，所以我们可以经过 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"V-1","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"022f9822-57c4-499c-89b3-c24156c808d4","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"V-1","type":"inline-math"},{"text":" 次松弛操作后再次进行一次松弛操作，如果在这次的松弛操作中，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"dis","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中有元素的值发生改变，那么就说明存在负权环。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7f66a446-c43d-4893-beb4-9a2598d4f9bb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.Collections;\n\npublic class BellmanFord {\n    private int[] dis;\n    private WeightedGraph graph;\n    private int s;\n    private boolean hasNegativeCycle = false;\n    private int[] pre;\n\n    public BellmanFord(WeightedGraph graph, int s) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        graph.validateVertex(s);\n        this.s = s;\n        this.dis = new int[graph.V()];\n        this.pre = new int[graph.V()];\n\n        Arrays.fill(dis, Integer.MAX_VALUE);\n        Arrays.fill(pre, -1);\n        dis[s] = 0;\n        pre[s] = s;\n\n        // k 代表轮数\n        for (int k = 1; k < graph.V(); k++) {\n            // 对所有边进行松弛操作，v-w 与 w-v 是两条边\n            for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n                for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n                    if (dis[v] != Integer.MAX_VALUE\n                            && dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w) < dis[w]) {\n                        dis[w] = dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w);\n                        pre[w] = v;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        // 再次进行一次松弛操作，检测负权环\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n                if (dis[v] != Integer.MAX_VALUE\n                        && (dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w) < dis[w])) {\n                    hasNegativeCycle = true;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public int[] result() {\n        return dis;\n    }\n\n    public Iterable<Integer> path(int t) {\n        ArrayList<Integer> path = new ArrayList<>();\n        int cur = t;\n        while (cur != s) {\n            path.add(cur);\n            cur = pre[cur];\n        }\n        path.add(s);\n\n        Collections.reverse(path);\n        return path;\n    }\n    \n    public boolean isHasNegativeCycle() {\n        return hasNegativeCycle;\n    }\n}","collabId":"4911fd96-abcb-489d-8005-0c06a42f90ca","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"95d717f4-fdfc-41ce-843c-485e1f208991","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"6e99a8ef-1c45-421d-8e63-ba415f1aef4b"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"最短路径算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:625","type":"doc","id":625}},{"label":"Bellman-Ford 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:627","type":"doc","id":627}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Dijkstra 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:626","type":"doc","id":626}},"nextPage":{"title":"Floyed 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:628","type":"doc","id":628}},"createTime":1702089678581,"updateTime":1793532541604,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532541604}}